# id|enabled|kind|freq|p1|p2|title|description
# Loaded once at gametype init (server start / map change). Edit then change map.
# Full reference: awards.md
# freq: every | map | round | once
#   round = once per match playtime (not CA/bomb intra-match rounds)
# Duration params are seconds. ping_high: p1=ping threshold, p2=seconds (0 = spike).
# range_kill / air_kill: p1 = minimum 3D distance (units). air_kill also needs an airborne victim.
# multi_kill: p1 = frag count, p2 = window seconds.
# p2 filters: weapon / ammo / key name or tag (0 = any where allowed). See awards.md.
lag_lord|1|ping_high|every|100|60|Lag Lord|Held ping over 100 for 60 seconds
first_blood|1|first_blood|round|0|0|First Blood|First kill of the match
killing_spree|1|kill_streak|round|8|0|Killing Spree|8 kills without dying
rampage|1|kill_streak|round|12|0|Rampage|12 kills without dying
payback|1|revenge|round|4|0|Payback|Killed the player who got 4 consecutive kills on you
breakneck|1|speed_kill|every|1200|0|Breakneck|Frag while moving at least 1200 ups
long_shot|1|range_kill|every|2000|electrobolt|Long Shot|Electrobolt frag from at least 2000 units
from_downtown|1|range_kill|every|1500|rocketlauncher|From Downtown|Rocket frag from at least 1500 units
eagle_eye|1|range_kill|every|2500|instagun|Eagle Eye|Instagun frag from at least 2500 units
excellent|1|multi_kill|every|2|2|Excellent|2 frags within 2 seconds
midair|1|air_kill|every|800|rocketlauncher|Midair|Rocket frag on an airborne player at least 800 units away
humiliation|1|weapon_kill|round|1|gunblade|Humiliation|Frag with the gunblade
rocket_man|1|weapon_kill|round|3|rocketlauncher|Rocket Man|3 kills with the rocket launcher
